Third-party icons

The SVG files in the aws/, azure/ and gcp/ folders are the cloud providers' own icons. pogi shows them
next to its services in the console and in the Terraform diagram. They are copied unchanged. They are NOT under the MIT licence
of the rest of this repository; each provider's terms apply to them.

AWS (aws/): Architecture Icons from Amazon Web Services.
  Terms: https://aws.amazon.com/architecture/icons/
  "We allow customers and partners to use these toolkits and assets to create architecture diagrams."

Azure (azure/): Azure Public Service Icons (V24) from Microsoft.
  Terms: https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/architecture/icons/#icon-terms
  Use is allowed in architecture diagrams, training materials or documentation. Do not crop, flip,
  rotate, distort or reshape the icons.

Google Cloud (gcp/): product and category icons from Google Cloud.
  Terms: https://cloud.google.com/icons
  The owner has read Google's terms. A product with no icon of its own shows the icon of its category.

A service with no official icon shows one of pogi's own plain glyphs (not in this folder).

All product names and logos belong to their owners. Their use here does not mean the owners
sponsor or endorse pogi.
